3. JavaCPP -- REDISTRIBUTED IN THE MOD JAR (Apache License 2.0)
================================================================================
    Project: https://github.com/bytedeco/javacpp
    Build:   org.bytedeco:javacpp:1.5.9
    License: Apache License, Version 2.0
    Text:    META-INF/licenses/javacpp-LICENSE-Apache-2.0.txt

    Provides the Java <-> native bridge used to call FFmpeg. The mod jar
    contains its JNI libraries for windows-x86_64, linux-x86_64 and
    linux-arm64.

    The Windows build of JavaCPP additionally ships the Microsoft Visual C++
    runtime redistributable libraries that its native code links against
    (msvcp140, vcruntime140, ucrtbase, concrt140, vcomp140 and the
    api-ms-win-* CRT forwarders). These are redistributed under the Microsoft
    Visual Studio redistributable terms and originate from the upstream
    org.bytedeco:javacpp:windows-x86_64 artifact.

